{"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"externalID":"PushwooshNotificationUI","roleHeading":"Framework","role":"collection","modules":[{"name":"PushwooshNotificationUI"}],"symbolKind":"module","title":"PushwooshNotificationUI"},"topicSections":[{"title":"Stories UI","identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshNotificationUI\/documentation\/PushwooshNotificationUI\/PushwooshStoriesViewController"]},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshNotificationUI\/documentation\/PushwooshNotificationUI\/StoryPage"],"title":"Payload model"},{"title":"Analytics","identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshNotificationUI\/documentation\/PushwooshNotificationUI\/PushwooshStoriesDelegate"]},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshNotificationUI\/documentation\/PushwooshNotificationUI\/PushwooshStoriesMediaPrefetcher"],"title":"Media pre-cache"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"PushwooshNotificationUI provides ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshNotificationUI\/documentation\/PushwooshNotificationUI\/PushwooshStoriesViewController"},{"type":"text","text":" — a drop-in"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"UNNotificationContentExtension","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" view controller that renders an Instagram-style"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"stories experience: full-bleed images, top progress bars, auto-advance, tap-zone","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"navigation, per-frame title\/subtitle, and an optional deep-link button.","type":"text"}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The module links only UIKit, UserNotifications, and UserNotificationsUI (plus","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"CryptoKit for a stable cache key), so it adds no Pushwoosh Core\/Framework weight","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"to your memory-constrained extension process."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Usage","type":"heading","text":"Usage"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In your Notification Content Extension:"}]},{"code":["import PushwooshNotificationUI","","class NotificationViewController: PushwooshStoriesViewController {}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Then set these keys in the extension’s Info.plist:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UNNotificationExtensionCategory"},{"text":" = ","type":"text"},{"code":"PW_STORIES","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (must match ","type":"text"},{"code":"aps.category","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":")","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UNNotificationExtensionUserInteractionEnabled"},{"text":" = ","type":"text"},{"code":"YES","type":"codeVoice"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UNNotificationExtensionDefaultContentHidden"},{"text":" = ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"YES"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"UNNotificationExtensionInitialContentSizeRatio","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" = e.g. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"1.5"},{"text":" (keep in sync with ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshNotificationUI\/documentation\/PushwooshNotificationUI\/PushwooshStoriesViewController\/storyAspectRatio"},{"type":"text","text":")"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSExtensionPrincipalClass"},{"text":" = ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"$(PRODUCT_MODULE_NAME).NotificationViewController"},{"text":" (code-only, no storyboard)","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"text":"Payload","type":"heading","anchor":"Payload","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The stories are described by a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"pw_stories"},{"type":"text","text":" block, alongside an "},{"code":"aps.category","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"matching ","type":"text"},{"code":"UNNotificationExtensionCategory","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". The parser accepts the block either at","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"payload root","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" (e.g. via the Pushwoosh API "},{"code":"ios_root_params","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") or inside the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"custom-data container "},{"code":"u","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" \/ "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"userdata"},{"type":"text","text":" (the Pushwoosh API "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"data"},{"type":"text","text":" field — delivered as"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"a dictionary or a JSON-encoded string). The root form on the device looks like this:"}]},{"code":["{","  \"aps\": { \"category\": \"PW_STORIES\" },","  \"pw_stories\": { \"pages\": [","    { \"image\": \"https:\/\/...\/1.jpg\", \"duration\": 5.0,","      \"link\": \"myapp:\/\/sale\", \"button_title\": \"Buy\",","      \"title\": \"Summer Sale\", \"subtitle\": \"Up to 70% off\" },","    { \"image\": \"https:\/\/...\/2.jpg\" }","  ]}","}"],"syntax":"json","type":"codeListing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Sent through the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"data"},{"text":" API field instead (recommended, since it does not depend on","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"ios_root_params","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"), the same block arrives nested under "},{"code":"u","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" — while "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"aps.category"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(and "},{"code":"mutable-content","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" for the pre-cache path) still go through ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ios_root_params.aps"},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"as there is no dedicated request field for them. The relevant createMessage fields:","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"json","code":["{","  \"ios_root_params\": { \"aps\": { \"category\": \"PW_STORIES\", \"mutable-content\": 1 } },","  \"data\": { \"pw_stories\": { \"pages\": [ { \"image\": \"https:\/\/...\/1.jpg\" } ] } }","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The parser tries the root first, then "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"u"},{"type":"text","text":" \/ "},{"code":"userdata","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", so both delivery styles work"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"and old pushes keep rendering.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Every field except "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"image"},{"text":" is optional. ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"link"},{"type":"text","text":" (like "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"image"},{"text":") must include a URL","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"scheme. A missing, empty, or malformed payload falls back to the default content","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"(the alert body) without crashing — override ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshNotificationUI\/documentation\/PushwooshNotificationUI\/PushwooshStoriesViewController\/showDefaultContent(for:)"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"text":"Analytics","anchor":"Analytics","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Set "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshNotificationUI\/documentation\/PushwooshNotificationUI\/PushwooshStoriesViewController\/storiesDelegate"},{"text":" to observe lifecycle and","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"engagement and forward it to your analytics (the module itself sends nothing):"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["class NotificationViewController: PushwooshStoriesViewController, PushwooshStoriesDelegate {","    override func viewDidLoad() {","        super.viewDidLoad()","        storiesDelegate = self","    }","    func storiesViewController(_ c: PushwooshStoriesViewController, didTapActionFor page: StoryPage, at index: Int) {","        \/\/ forward the per-page click to your backend","    }","}"]},{"text":"Instant \/ offline first frame (App Group pre-cache)","anchor":"Instant--offline-first-frame-App-Group-pre-cache","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To make the first frame appear instantly (and offline), pre-download the media in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"a Notification ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Service","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" Extension into a shared App Group container that the"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"Content Extension reads from:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"orderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Enable the ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"App Groups","type":"text"}]},{"text":" capability (same id) on both the Service and Content","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"extensions, and override "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshNotificationUI\/documentation\/PushwooshNotificationUI\/PushwooshStoriesViewController\/appGroupIdentifier","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"From the Service Extension’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"didReceive(_:withContentHandler: